        "assumptions": {
          "ja": "単位弦・張力密度1、同次Dirichlet、内部15/31/63点、最低3固有対。",
          "en": "A unit string with unit tension and density and homogeneous Dirichlet endpoints. Use 15, 31 and 63 interior nodes and the lowest three eigenpairs."
        },
        "algorithm": {
          "ja": "要素からK,Mを組み立て、M内積のK^-1M KrylovとSciPy LOBPCGを比較。小規模な厳密K逆前処理。 LOBPCG初期列は{1,x³,x⁶}。K逆Mの次数+2像を初期spanから独立にし、{1,x,x²}の構造的階数欠落を避ける。 同じMの作用を資格済einsumのLinearOperatorで与え、dense-B adapterを通さない。固有値solver自体はSciPy LOBPCG。",
          "en": "Elementwise K and M assembly, M-inner-product Krylov iteration on K^-1 M, and actual SciPy LOBPCG with a small exact-K-inverse preconditioner. LOBPCG starts from {1, x^3, x^6}; degree-plus-two images avoid the structural rank defect of {1, x, x^2}. The same M is applied through a qualified einsum LinearOperator, avoiding the dense-B adapter. The eigensolver itself remains SciPy LOBPCG."
        },
        "validation": {
          "ja": "一般化dense eigh、独立離散スペクトル、連続体(jπ)^2への細分化。M直交性と元残差は別量。",
          "en": "Generalized dense eigh, an independent discrete spectrum and refinement toward (j*pi)^2. M-orthogonality and original residuals are distinct quantities."
        },
        "limits": {
          "ja": "小規模1D弦のみ。SciPyが返す前の例外では入力を保存し、未返却の内部反復を保存したとはしません。 成分資格35判定は4科学例の合格を代用せず、元SciPy内部の未返却反復は保存済みとしません。",
          "en": "A small 1D string only. If SciPy raises before returning, inputs are retained; unreturned internal iterates are not claimed to be saved. The 35 component checks do not replace the four full scientific cases."
        },
        "review_level": {
          "ja": "入力・16独立参照・195科学判定は旧版から不変。R4科学実行の実際の成否はresult.json/verification.jsonへ記録し、旧失敗と別に保持します。",
          "en": "The fixed inputs, 16 independent reference checks and 195 scientific gates are unchanged. R4 passed the primary validation; actual package checks are recorded in result.json and verification.json. Earlier failed attempts remain separate."
        },
        "formulas": [
          "K x=lambda M x",
          "lambda_j,h=6(1-cos(theta_j))/[h^2(2+cos(theta_j))]",
          "X^T M X=I"
        ],
